{"version":1,"content":"<p>旅行者1號已成為首個距離地球一光日的人造物體，目前距地球約161億英裏。美國國家航空航天局表示，這艘探測器於2026年11月18日凌晨5時16分（美國東部時間）正式越過一光日門檻，此時距其發射已近五十年。確認信號在整整24小時後抵達地球，西班牙馬德裏附近的一座地面天線接收到了探測器發回的信號。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1588206.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T10:03:52.154958+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":152,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T09:41:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T09:57:14.240428+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T09:57:14.240428+00:00","content_hash":"b9357977bbddc90b1c77b32bba4f0fd70c49bd077ea365a356e3fe246b51c82e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}